  {
   "id": 200,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -2500,
    5700
   ],
   "size": [
    440,
    961
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 13,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Note: LynnReal Standard 4-step DMD",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LynnReal Standard · 4-step DMD (Ref2VA)\n\nThis copy of the official R2V template is wired for the LynnReal Standard checkpoint.\n\n**Changes from the official template**\n\n- `UNETLoader`: `lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` (BF16, full-form adaLN, fused QKV)\n- `BasicScheduler`: `simple` with **4 steps**. Sigma shift stays at the model default, video 12 / audio 3.\n- `KSamplerSelect`: `euler`, the solver the checkpoint was distilled against. `res_multistep` also runs, but can drift at 4 steps.\n- The Lightning LoRA and the model / steps switches are removed; this checkpoint is already distilled.\n- `ref_image_size`: `max` (2048 short edge), matching the diffusers reference pipeline default.\n\nText encoder and both VAE loaders are unchanged from the official template.\n\n**Precision — INT8 (optional)**\n\nThe **`Use INT8 model?`** switch above the loader (default **off**) swaps `UNETLoader` from\n`lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` to `lynnreal_omni_standard_int8.safetensors`. Same\nW8A8 contract as the release's `--precision int8` path: per-output-channel weight scales,\nper-token activation scales, INT32 accumulate; block 0, the last block, the token refiner,\nadaLN and the IO projections stay BF16.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## LynnReal Standard · 4-step DMD (Ref2VA)\n\nThis copy of the official R2V template is wired for the LynnReal Standard checkpoint.\n\n**Changes from the official template**\n\n- `UNETLoader`: `lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` (BF16, full-form adaLN, fused QKV)\n- `BasicScheduler`: `simple` with **4 steps**. Sigma shift stays at the model default, video 12 / audio 3.\n- `KSamplerSelect`: `euler`, the solver the checkpoint was distilled against. `res_multistep` also runs, but can drift at 4 steps.\n- The Lightning LoRA and the model / steps switches are removed; this checkpoint is already distilled.\n- `ref_image_size`: `max` (2048 short edge), matching the diffusers reference pipeline default.\n\nText encoder and both VAE loaders are unchanged from the official template.\n\n**Precision — INT8 (optional)**\n\nThe **`Use INT8 model?`** switch above the loader (default **off**) swaps `UNETLoader` from\n`lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` to `lynnreal_omni_standard_int8.safetensors`. Same\nW8A8 contract as the release's `--precision int8` path: per-output-channel weight scales,\nper-token activation scales, INT32 accumulate; block 0, the last block, the token refiner,\nadaLN and the IO projections stay BF16.\n"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
